{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415710","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415710","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041571001:1":{"text":"外面，下雨了……好潮湿……","source_cn":"外面，下雨了……好潮湿……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE41898A3DC78F787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041571002:0":{"text":"你不喜欢雨天吗？空气会很清新。","source_cn":"你不喜欢雨天吗？空气会很清新。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EE2368FD949776C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041571003:1":{"text":"下雨……不舒服。心情不好。","source_cn":"下雨……不舒服。心情不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB062D3F9D71A683","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041571004:1":{"text":"如果雨很大，羽毛会被打湿……这很危险。","source_cn":"如果雨很大，羽毛会被打湿……这很危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CD571166D7E504B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041571005:1":{"text":"你可以躲起来，避雨。","source_cn":"你可以躲起来，避雨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21CFB1875FABD6A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041571006:1":{"text":"不，不行。主君给我的任务，还没有完成……","source_cn":"不，不行。主君给我的任务，还没有完成……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAD49B6AE8FF847C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041571007:1":{"text":"主君？那是谁？","source_cn":"主君？那是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D6D4DBA2A22DDE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041571008:1":{"text":"主君……就是主君。救了我的人。","source_cn":"主君……就是主君。救了我的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF46BAAF661E3FEBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041571009:1":{"text":"你的主君是个好人吗？会给你食物，照顾你吗？","source_cn":"你的主君是个好人吗？会给你食物，照顾你吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04C45971A3641670","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041571010:1":{"text":"照顾……我？主君不该做这种事。","source_cn":"照顾……我？主君不该做这种事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F4498E3EEC98F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041571011:1":{"text":"我是主君的仆人……不，我和仆人不一样。","source_cn":"我是主君的仆人……不，我和仆人不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4F7EB49A784FD4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041571012:1":{"text":"我只要完成任务……不需要，照顾主君。","source_cn":"我只要完成任务……不需要，照顾主君。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9654A38C2A0C949B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041571013:1":{"text":"你的主君给你什么任务？","source_cn":"你的主君给你什么任务？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA51D126BCED3DEBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041571014:1":{"text":"……抓老鼠。讨厌的、捣乱的老鼠。","source_cn":"……抓老鼠。讨厌的、捣乱的老鼠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE038E6D3F07DC4BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041571015:1":{"text":"这里没有老鼠。我不太明白你要做什么。","source_cn":"这里没有老鼠。我不太明白你要做什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC150FC0C62FFF9C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041571016:1":{"text":"但是，和我一起躲雨吧。","source_cn":"但是，和我一起躲雨吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ACF67893E419504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041571017:1":{"text":"在雨天，所有鸟儿都有休息的权利。","source_cn":"在雨天，所有鸟儿都有休息的权力。","status":"matched","ha